Emerging Market Opportunities
Advanced logic, system-on-chip and high-bandwidth memory development creates opportunities for fine-pitch and high-parallelism probe-card solutions. Growth in semiconductor testing requirements may also support demand for specialized vertical and MEMS-based contact technologies.

Further opportunities exist in improved contact materials, longer tip life, advanced signal-integrity engineering and automated maintenance solutions. Suppliers that can support customized designs and reliable servicing may strengthen their position with foundries and outsourced semiconductor assembly and test providers.

